From f924b028ac6cc4454337d22cc77dd43ef2ec4fff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Doug Rabson <dfr@rabson.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Jan 2023 17:47:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] api: Change TerminationMessagePathDefault on FreeBSD

The Linux default path "/dev/termination-log" cannot work on FreeBSD.
The FreeBSD devfs filesystem does not allow regular files which prevents
mounting the log into /dev. This changes the default path to
"/var/run/termination-log" on FreeBSD.
